SUMMARY:ISABEL VAN GELDER (NL) / SAGE DARLEY (Uhrzeit prüfen)
LOCATION:Chelsea
DESCRIPTION: ISABEL VAN GELDER is a 23-year-old singer-songwriter/pop artist from Amsterdam. Her angelic sound and presence shine through in her impressive songs: emotionally layered storytelling ballads\, balanced with carefree\, upbeat tracks. In both extremes\, Isabel effortlessly weaves dreamy melodies with deeply personal lyrics\, and audiences listen closely. Since the release of her singles Die For You and My Silly Boy\, it has become impossible to ignore Isabel. Her videos on Instagram and TikTok have amassed millions of views\, while her debut EP ‘Minor Details’ has reached millions of streams on Spotify. When she announced her first European tour\, it sold out within weeks. Now\, she is announcing a brand-new and expanded European tour\, featuring larger venues and many more cities. Isabel van Gelder is that “hidden gem” you won’t be able to overlook much longer. www.instagram.com/isabelvangelder/ www.tiktok.com/@itsizzss https://youtu.be/Y6F_Q98u-ns?si=d2nSS2UV487PEZ-b https://youtu.be/3TQG5zr6YNE?si=HSZ23cH-QoP_-AZg    SAGE DARLEY Mystery\, memory and melancholy. Sage Darley creates music that resembles a glimpse into a hidden diary\, cinematic\, mysterious and atmospherically dense. Raised in Tunisia and now based in Innsbruck\, she combines intimacy with striking imagery and a touch of magic. Even before releasing a single song\, Sage Darley drew attention with intense live shows\, among others at the renowned Treibhaus\, as support for Sofie Royer\, or at festivals such as Woodlight\, Alles Gute or Bogenfest. In autumn and winter 2025\, she released two singles from her upcoming EP: Not Real\, a melancholic hymn between indie pop and slowcore about longing and self discovery (release date September 26\, 2025) and Youth\, an atmospheric song about memories and change (release date December 5\, 2025). www.instagram.com/sagedarley/    Tickets: www.oeticket.com/event/introduction-night-chelsea-21334120/?affiliate=EOE
URL:https://www.chelsea.co.at/concerts.php#concert_6630
END:VEVENT
